  "worked_solution": "The elements of $A$ are all the terms of the *recursive* sequence ${a}_{n},$ given by\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=3{a}_{n}-4,\\,{a}_{1}=0,\\,n\\in N.\n$$\n\nLet's write down the first few terms of our sequence:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} & =0 \\\\ {a}_{2} & =3{a}_{1}-4 \\\\  & =3(0)-4 \\\\  & =-4 \\\\ {a}_{3} & =3{a}_{2}-4 \\\\  & =3(-4)-4 \\\\  & =-16 \\\\ {a}_{4} & =3{a}_{3}-4 \\\\  & =3(-16)-4 \\\\  & =-52 \\\\  & \u22ee\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nA={0,-4,-16,-52,\u2026}.\n$$",
